{"rev":13,"ts":"2026-10-05T19:20:04.452471200+00:00","fields":{"__previous_part_content__":"## Validation commands\n\n- `cargo test --manifest-path workflow-tools/memory-kernel/Cargo.toml`\n- `cargo test --manifest-path workflow-tools/test/crates/test-mcp/Cargo.toml`\n\nThe memory-kernel suite covers resolver and path-classification regressions. The Test MCP suite must cover write rejection for nonexistent and existing explicit legacy-shaped `.test` paths, legacy read compatibility, and an allowed direct canonical `.workflow-tools/test` path. Record the observed results and read-back evidence before review.","__previous_part_id__":"aa086717-f165-4303-af18-a6744fd31250","component":"memory-kernel","effort":"1000","linked":["31e70dab-c379-47a9-8164-77bcb50b038d","db3ebe07-6517-4625-9652-538b0681890f"],"parts":[{"id":"0139c629-41aa-4e52-94a4-578082b31763","kind":"objective","path":"parts/0139c629-41aa-4e52-94a4-578082b31763.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.131756100Z"},{"id":"d0e62ea2-0e14-4936-8110-8537346766b9","kind":"requirements","path":"parts/d0e62ea2-0e14-4936-8110-8537346766b9.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.133770900Z"},{"id":"6359f0e7-dbfa-4930-a040-d4f0363be385","kind":"design","path":"parts/6359f0e7-dbfa-4930-a040-d4f0363be385.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.135663200Z"},{"id":"23c0f1fd-1061-4cdc-a3d2-86d5eaf15fd9","kind":"examples","path":"parts/23c0f1fd-1061-4cdc-a3d2-86d5eaf15fd9.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.136768600Z"},{"id":"021dcf60-7ce0-4791-b217-3b85138c53ce","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/021dcf60-7ce0-4791-b217-3b85138c53ce.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.137871500Z"},{"id":"aa086717-f165-4303-af18-a6744fd31250","kind":"validation","path":"parts/aa086717-f165-4303-af18-a6744fd31250.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:41:58.928163200Z"},{"id":"74db1384-970c-431f-a4c4-705023b2680e","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/7