{"rev":17,"ts":"2026-10-05T20:26:26.031504300+00:00","fields":{"__previous_part_content__":"## Final validation evidence\n\n- `cargo test --manifest-path workflow-tools/memory-kernel/Cargo.toml`: 225 passed, 2 suites.\n- `cargo test --manifest-path workflow-tools/test/crates/test-mcp/Cargo.toml`: 12 passed, 5 suites.\n- `git diff --check` on the 3 touched source/test files passed; VS Code diagnostics: no errors.\n- ValidationExecution `exec-domain-store-no-marker-g1-20261005` was read back as `passed` and links the workspace Spec and ticket `6cf90b00-b6d0-4da0-8af8-1b0aba3dc057`.\n\n## User-visible behavior\n\nExplicitly supplied `.test` paths, whether existing, nonexistent, or a child path, are rejected on Test MCP mutation handlers. Legacy-only explicit reads remain accepted. Canonical direct store paths remain accepted.","__previous_part_id__":"aa086717-f165-4303-af18-a6744fd31250","component":"memory-kernel","effort":"1000","linked":["31e70dab-c379-47a9-8164-77bcb50b038d","db3ebe07-6517-4625-9652-538b0681890f"],"parts":[{"id":"0139c629-41aa-4e52-94a4-578082b31763","kind":"objective","path":"parts/0139c629-41aa-4e52-94a4-578082b31763.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.131756100Z"},{"id":"d0e62ea2-0e14-4936-8110-8537346766b9","kind":"requirements","path":"parts/d0e62ea2-0e14-4936-8110-8537346766b9.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.133770900Z"},{"id":"6359f0e7-dbfa-4930-a040-d4f0363be385","kind":"design","path":"parts/6359f0e7-dbfa-4930-a040-d4f0363be385.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.135663200Z"},{"id":"23c0f1fd-1061-4cdc-a3d2-86d5eaf15fd9","kind":"examples","path":"parts/23c0f1fd-1061-4cdc-a3d2-86d5eaf15fd9.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.136768600Z"},{"id":"021dcf60-7ce0-4791-b217-3b85138c53ce","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/021dcf60-7ce0-4791-b217-3b85138c53ce.md","frozen":true,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:32:56.137871500Z"},{"id":"aa086717-f165-4303-af18-a6744fd31250","kind"